{"suttaId":"thi-ap39","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-iii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[10568,10615],"vripara":"204"},"segments":{"thi-ap39:0.3":"Ambapālitherīapadānaṃ","thi-ap39:1.1":"“Yo raṃsiphusitāveḷo, phusso nāma mahāmuni;","thi-ap39:1.3":"Tassāhaṃ bhaginī āsiṃ, ajāyiṃ khattiye kule.","thi-ap39:2.1":"“Tassa dhammaṃ suṇitvāhaṃ, vippasannena cetasā;","thi-ap39:2.3":"Mahādānaṃ daditvāna, patthayiṃ rūpasampadaṃ.","thi-ap39:3.1":"“Ekatiṃse ito kappe, sikhī lokagganāyako;","thi-ap39:3.3":"Uppanno lokapajjoto, tilokasaraṇo jino.","thi-ap39:4.1":"“Tadāruṇapure ramme, brāhmaññakulasambhavā;","thi-ap39:4.3":"Vimuttacittaṃ kupitā, bhikkhuniṃ abhisāpayiṃ.","thi-ap39:5.1":"“Vesikāva anācārā, jinasāsanadūsikā;","thi-ap39:5.3":"Evaṃ akkosayitvāna, tena pāpena kammunā.","thi-ap39:6.1":"“Dāruṇaṃ nirayaṃ gantvā, mahādukkhasamappitā;","thi-ap39:6.3":"Tato cutā manussesu, upapannā tapassinī.","thi-ap39:7.1":"“Dasajātisahassāni, gaṇikattamakārayiṃ;","thi-ap39:7.3":"Tamhā pāpā na muccissaṃ, bhutvā duṭṭhavisaṃ yathā.","thi-ap39:8.1":"“Brahmacariyamasevissaṃ [brahmavesamasevissaṃ (syā.), brahmaceramasevissaṃ (pī.)], kassape jinasāsane;","thi-ap39:8.3":"Tena kammavipākena, ajāyiṃ tidase pure.","thi-ap39:9.1":"“Pacchime bhave sampatte, ahosiṃ opapātikā;","thi-ap39:9.3":"Ambasākhantare jātā, ambapālīti tenahaṃ.","thi-ap39:10.1":"“Parivutā pāṇakoṭīhi, pabbajiṃ jinasāsane;","thi-ap39:10.3":"Pattāhaṃ acalaṃ ṭhānaṃ, dhītā buddhassa orasā.","thi-ap39:11.1":"“Iddhīsu ca vasī homi, sotadhātuvisuddhiyā;","thi-ap39:11.3":"Cetopariyañāṇassa, vasī homi mahāmune.","thi-ap39:12.1":"“Pubbenivāsaṃ jānāmi, dibbacakkhu visodhitaṃ;","thi-ap39:12.3":"Sabbāsavaparikkhīṇā, natthi dāni punabbhavo.","thi-ap39:13.1":"“Atthadhammaniruttīsu, paṭibhāne tatheva ca;","thi-ap39:13.3":"Ñāṇaṃ me vimalaṃ suddhaṃ, buddhaseṭṭhassa vāhasā.","thi-ap39:14.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavā.","thi-ap39:15.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","thi-ap39:16.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","thi-ap39:17.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ ambapāli bhikkhunī imā gāthāyo Abhāsitthāti.","thi-ap39:18.1":"Ambapālitheriyāpadānaṃ navamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
